                                                    </styleClass>
                                       <content>
                                          <AnchorPane prefHeight="1008.0" prefWidth="725.0">
                                             <children>
                                                <Text layoutX="15.0" layoutY="31.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="The Baust Question Bank (QBank) is a dedicated desktop application developed to serve the students and faculty members of the Bangladesh Army University of Science and Technology (BAUST). Designed with user-centric functionality in mind, QBank offers a centralized platform to store, access, and manage all academic question papers — from CTs to Finals — in an organized and searchable format." wrappingWidth="693.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="15.0" layoutY="137.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="This system is created with the aim of solving the longstanding issues of question paper accessibility, where students traditionally depend on class representatives, social media groups, or scattered online drives to obtain past papers. These methods are inconsistent, unsecure, and often biased towards certain batches or departments. QBank eliminates these barriers by offering an offline-accessible, image-supported, and metadata-tagged solution." wrappingWidth="692.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="14.0" layoutY="259.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="Key Features:" wrappingWidth="710.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font name="System Bold" size="19.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="284.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="1. Full support for categorization by Department, Course Title, Question Type, Batch, and                 Exam Code" wrappingWidth="651.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="334.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="2. Ability to upload questions in image format, preserving clarity and original formatting" wrappingWidth="651.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="364.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="3. Search and filter functionality for quick and structured question lookup" wrappingWidth="651.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="385.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="4. Clean and intuitive interface suitable for both technical and non-technical users" wrappingWidth="591.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="410.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="5. Admin panel for question moderation, updates, and user management" wrappingWidth="580.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="14.0" layoutY="450.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="Our Mission:" wrappingWidth="710.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font name="System Bold" size="20.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="477.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="To digitize the academic archive of BAUST and make educational resources equally accessible for all, regardless of semester, department, or network connection." wrappingWidth="651.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="14.0" layoutY="540.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="Our Vision:" wrappingWidth="710.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font name="System Bold" size="20.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="571.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="To become a model academic tool that inspires other institutions to adopt structured and transparent question paper management, improving exam preparation, academic equality, and institutional memory." wrappingWidth="651.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
                                                <Text layoutX="37.0" layoutY="635.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="We believe that every student deserves equal access to educational tools, and with QBank, we bring that vision closer to reality." wrappingWidth="651.9830722808838">
                                                   <font>
                                                      <Font size="16.0" />
                                                   </font>
                                                </Text>
